/-!
# Collapse of the ambient finite Hopf complex

The eighty-eight four-simplices in the seventeen-vertex finite Hopf construction admit an
explicit sequence of 336 elementary simplicial collapses. The endpoint is the single vertex
`5` (index `4`), so the affine carrier and geometric realization of the ambient complex are
contractible.

This is a homotopy-theoretic certificate. It does not by itself identify the ambient realization
with a four-disk; that stronger PL statement requires a subdivision or shelling comparison.
-/

